{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《2026香港小姐競選》決賽將於8月30日舉行，12位候選佳麗 今日（13日）到將軍澳東帝苑酒店進行泳裝拍攝，一眾佳麗穿着斜膊兩件頭泳裝會見傳媒，雖然 狀態大勇， 可惜雙色搭配泳裝的配搭性感欠奉，影響吸睛程度大減，令一向上圍出眾的 5號魏欣也顯得失色。 經過多個月來的密集式特訓與體形管理， 12位候選佳麗今日以泳衣登場展示健康體態，除了 5號魏欣之外， 2號李澤欣、 6號盧蔚晴、 8號鄧匡閔也各有睇頭。今日現場，大會同時宣布由師姐麥美恩帶領佳麗們於廣東從化拍攝的外景特備節目《香港小姐從化行》，將於星期日（8月16日）晚上10時05分首播。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178410/df/01KZX8Q0AH8D3MZ90QY4S9DRVN.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>1號袁絲珩</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178411/df/01KZX8QNR4E4554NRKH5Y9HMAR.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>2號李澤欣</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178412/df/01KZX8S06NYRSTJN8WN4YZNK7C.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>3號李澄晴</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178413/df/01KZX8SDNYBRGQPC32HEEHRWMD.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>4號譚雅文</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178414/df/01KZX8T9F2PPVQG7QRE5KZMPVP.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>5號魏欣</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178415/df/01KZX8TWF6P1ZH91HB6HADDAE0.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>6號盧蔚晴</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178416/df/01KZX8VB2W4GQT714PWTF4368M.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>7號楊媛媛</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178417/df/01KZX8WG47M0WEN0NRM0K113T2.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>8號鄧匡閔</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178418/df/01KZX8X8RBB4B0HKJBHQS22YR8.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>9號周芳姿</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178419/df/01KZX8XSN0QMYY0F682HWMNXQT.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>10號陳梓穎</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178420/df/01KZX8Y8RA6M3PFVFYDPXG9G5X.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>11號顏懿菲</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1047279/block/singleImage/3178421/df/01KZX8YR7S3AB3NH4J593V7M8S.jpg?updatedAt=1786615161\"/><figcaption>12號湯家琳</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T11:20:10.243019+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":12,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"}}